  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.shulker_boxes.materials": "Shulker boxes come in a whole set of materials, and the material decides how much one holds. Stone is the smallest and netherite the largest.\n\nMaterials are also grouped into storage levels, from 0 to 5. A level is what level upgrades step through.\n\nEverything Assorted Core adds has a place in that order too, which gives tin, silver, ruby and the rest somewhere useful to go.",
